  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a88c5233ff27ac0a534/step-4d675600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim green beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a88c5233ff27ac0a534/step-2c9c3710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook green beans, tossing regularly, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and set aside to cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a88c5233ff27ac0a534/step-de911520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To bowl with green beans, add rocket and balsamic vinaigrette dressing. Toss to combine and season.\n• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide plant-based crumbed chicken and balsamic green bean salad between plates. Top plant-based crumbed chicken with red pesto. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a88c5233ff27ac0a534/step-8e96ef30.jpg"
